n mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. There is a straight line that passes through these three points.\n\n![](images/fb/fb82255ac578efc90bb070dab669a19950387cab7d9011de4d5d0d94dd9de505.png)\n\n- Statement II is true. We can't draw a straight line that passes through these three points.\n\n![](images/2c/2c20ebe076b3e655b7709ccb337c68d4aa8505bfabdb5a8755e5a1410642d612.png)\n\n- Statement III is false. We can't draw a straight line that passes through these three points.\n\n![](images/98/9859ea0144923d69e37d64130910608f6fc3e7afe09d74af19a5402030e0d3cb.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""}]}
